{"unit_id": "tag:01P4:proof", "translation": "本引理的最后一个断言由拓扑学（Topology）引理 <REF_0001> 得出。（5）与（1）的等价性（equivalence）见拓扑学（Topology）引理 <REF_0002>。因此，由引理 <REF_0003> 可知（1）<MATH_0001>（2）。要完成本引理的证明，只需证明“雅各布森（Jacobson）”是环（rings）的一个局部性质（local property），见引理 <REF_0004>。任何局部化（localization），只要它是对雅各布森（Jacobson）环（ring）在一个元素（element）处取得的，就是雅各布森（Jacobson）的，见代数学（Algebra）引理 <REF_0005>。假设<MATH_0002>是一个环（ring），<MATH_0003>生成单位理想（ideal），且每个<MATH_0004>都是雅各布森（Jacobson）的。由此可见，<MATH_0005>是一些开子集（open subsets）的并集（union），这些子集均为雅各布森（Jacobson）的。因此<MATH_0006>是雅各布森（Jacobson）的，这再次由拓扑学（Topology）引理 <REF_0006> 得出。这就证明了定义 <REF_0007> 中的第二条性质。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑学"}, {"source_term": "equivalence", "target_term": "等价性"}, {"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑学"}, {"source_term": "Jacobson", "target_term": "雅各布森"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "local property", "target_term": "局部性质"}, {"source_term": "localization", "target_term": "局部化"}, {"source_term": "Jacobson", "target_term": "雅各布森"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素"}, {"source_term": "Jacobson", "target_term": "雅各布森"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数学"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "ideal", "target_term": "理想"}, {"source_term": "Jacobson", "target_term": "雅各布森"}, {"source_term": "open subsets", "target_term": "开子集"}, {"source_term": "union", "target_term": "并集"}, {"source_term": "Jacobson", "target_term": "雅各布森"}, {"source_term": "Jacobson", "target_term": "雅各布森"}, {"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑学"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑学", "context": "末条断言所引引理的章节名。"}, {"source_term": "equivalence", "target_term": "等价性", "context": "指条件（5）与（1）之间的关系。"}, {"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑学", "context": "（5）与（1）的等价性所引引理的章节名。"}, {"source_term": "Jacobson", "target_term": "雅各布森", "context": "待证为环的局部性质。"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环", "context": "局部性质所适用的代数对象。"}, {"source_term": "local property", "target_term": "局部性质", "context": "指引理所引用的关于环的局部性。"}, {"source_term": "localization", "target_term": "局部化", "context": "在一个元素处取得的代数对象。"}, {"source_term": "Jacobson", "target_term": "雅各布森", "context": "被局部化的环所具有的性质。"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "取局部化的代数对象。"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素", "context": "取局部化所用的环中元素。"}, {"source_term": "Jacobson", "target_term": "雅各布森", "context": "局部化所得对象所具有的性质。"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数学", "context": "单元素局部化断言所引引理的章节名。"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "验证局部性质时假设给定的代数对象。"}, {"source_term": "ideal", "target_term": "理想", "context": "指给定元素所生成的单位理想。"}, {"source_term": "Jacobson", "target_term": "雅各布森", "context": "假设每个给定局部化都具有的性质。"}, {"source_term": "open subsets", "target_term": "开子集", "context": "构成所述并集的子集。"}, {"source_term": "union", "target_term": "并集", "context": "合并所述开子集得到的集合。"}, {"source_term": "Jacobson", "target_term": "雅各布森", "context": "所述各开子集均具有的性质。"}, {"source_term": "Jacobson", "target_term": "雅各布森", "context": "由各开子集推得的整体性质。"}, {"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑学", "context": "由开子集推出该性质所引引理的章节名。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01P1:prose-0004", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n许多在代数几何（algebraic geometry）中常用的概形（schemes）都是雅各布森（Jacobson）的，见态射（Morphisms）引理 <REF_0001>。这里我们提及下面这个有趣的情形。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "algebraic geometry", "target_term": "代数几何"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "Jacobson", "target_term": "雅各布森"}, {"source_term": "Morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "algebraic geometry", "target_term": "代数几何", "context": "指这些概形常用于其中的数学领域。"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "具有雅各布森性质的一类对象。"}, {"source_term": "Jacobson", "target_term": "雅各布森", "context": "许多常用概形所具有的性质。"}, {"source_term": "Morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "支持该断言的引理所在章节名。"}], "notes": []}
